^^detailed_steps
Login to the application with admin credentials
Navigate to the Users page
Click on the options ('...') button next to a user
Select 'Deactivate' from the dropdown menu --> Verify that the user's status is updated to 'Inactive'
Refresh the page or navigate away and return to the Users page --> Verify that the user's status remains 'Inactive' after the page refresh
